# ── hyperframes/ — per-operator LOCAL-ONLY plane (like raw/) ──────────────────
# Individual video projects live here but are NOT pushed — each operator makes
# their own ("mỗi user sẽ khác nhau"). Only README.md + .gitkeep are committed.
# To share ONE specific canonical video, force it past the ignore:
#   git add -f video/hyperframes/<slug>
hyperframes/*
!hyperframes/README.md
!hyperframes/.gitkeep

# ── renders / working artifacts (anywhere under video/) — reproducible ────────
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
**/snapshots/
**/.thumbnails/
**/.hyperframes/
**/node_modules/
**/.media/
